# Bible Study Vault

Start at [[MOCs/Books MOC]]. The vault currently includes every book for which the source project has complete book, seed, and rule data.

## Personalizing your vault

This is your local copy. Add and edit notes anywhere in it; the updater does not overwrite your customized notes or delete files.

## Getting updates

Run this from the vault folder when you want to check for the latest GitHub Release:

```bash
python3 update_vault.py
```

If a released note and your edited copy have both changed, your copy stays in place. The incoming version is saved under `Updates/<release>/` for you to compare. Notes you deleted are not restored automatically.
